emma":"yām","gloss":"we"}],"gloss":"we"},{"surface":"தனக்கு","parts":[{"text":"தனக்கு","lemma":"தனக்கு","gloss":"to him"}],"gloss":"to him","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"உறுமறை","parts":[{"text":"உறு","lemma":"uṟu","gloss":"close"},{"text":"மறை","lemma":"maṟai","gloss":"confidence"}],"gloss":"close confidence"},{"surface":"வளாவ","parts":[{"text":"வளாவ","lemma":"vaḷāvu","gloss":"to mingle"}],"gloss":"to mingle"},{"surface":"விலக்கி","parts":[{"text":"விலக்கி","lemma":"vilakku","gloss":"having warded off"}],"gloss":"warding off"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வாய்வாள்","parts":[{"text":"வாய்","lemma":"vāy","gloss":"sharp"},{"text":"வாள்","lemma":"vāḷ","gloss":"sword"}],"gloss":"sharp sword"},{"surface":"பற்றி","parts":[{"text":"பற்றி","lemma":"paṟṟu","gloss":"having grasped"}],"gloss":"grasping"},{"surface":"நின்றனென்","parts":[{"text":"நின்றனென்","lemma":"நின்றனென்","gloss":"he stood"}],"gloss":"he stood","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"என்று","parts":[{"text":"என்று","lemma":"eṉṟu","gloss":"saying"}],"gloss":"saying"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"சினவல்","parts":[{"text":"சினவல்","lemma":"ciṉa","gloss":"anger"}],"gloss":"anger"},{"surface":"ஓம்புமின்","parts":[{"text":"ஓம்புமின்","lemma":"ōmpu","gloss":"refrain from"}],"gloss":"refrain from"},{"surface":"சிறுபுல்லாளர்","parts":[{"text":"சிறு","lemma":"ciṟu","gloss":"petty"},{"text":"புல்","lemma":"pul","gloss":"lowly"},{"text":"ஆளர்","lemma":"āḷar","gloss":"men"}],"gloss":"men of little worth"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஈண்டே","parts":[{"text":"ஈண்டு","lemma":"īṇṭu","gloss":"here"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"right here"},{"surface":"போல","parts":[{"text":"போல","lemma":"pōla","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"},{"surface":"வேண்டுவன்","parts":[{"text":"வேண்டுவன்","lemma":"vēṇṭu","gloss":"he desires"}],"gloss":"he desires"},{"surface":"ஆயின்","parts":[{"text":"ஆயின்","lemma":"āyiṉ","gloss":"if"}],"gloss":"if"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"என்முறை","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"eṉ","gloss":"my"},{"text":"முறை","lemma":"muṟai","gloss":"turn"}],"gloss":"my turn"},{"surface":"வருக","parts":[{"text":"வருக","lemma":"varu","gloss":"let it come"}],"gloss":"let it come"},{"surface":"என்னான்","parts":[{"text":"என்னான்","lemma":"eṉ","gloss":"without saying"}],"gloss":"without saying"},{"surface":"கம்மென","parts":[{"text":"கம்","lemma":"kam","gloss":"swiftly"},{"text":"என","lemma":"eṉa","gloss":"as"}],"gloss":"swiftly"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"எழுதரு","parts":[{"text":"எழு","lemma":"eḻu","gloss":"rise"},{"text":"தரு","lemma":"taru","gloss":"surge"}],"gloss":"surging"},{"surface":"பெரும்படை","parts":[{"text":"பெருமை","lemma":"perumai","gloss":"great"},{"text":"படை","lemma":"paṭai","gloss":"army"}],"gloss":"great army"},{"surface":"விலக்கி","parts":[{"text":"விலக்கி","lemma":"vilakku","gloss":"having warded off"}],"gloss":"warding off"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஆண்டு","parts":[{"text":"ஆண்டு","lemma":"āṇṭu","gloss":"there"}],"gloss":"there"},{"surface":"நிற்கும்","parts":[{"text":"நிற்கும்","lemma":"nil","gloss":"will stand"}],"gloss":"will stand"},{"surface":"ஆண்தகையன்னே","parts":[{"text":"ஆண்","lemma":"āṇ","gloss":"manliness"},{"text":"தகை","lemma":"takai","gloss":"quality"},{"text":"அன்","lemma":"aṉ","gloss":"he"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"he is of manly character"}]}],"literal":"To the king, offered sweet cool toddy, / warding off [us] as we [tried] to mingle in his close confidence, / saying \"he stood grasping his sharp sword\" - / refrain from anger, O men of little worth! / If he desires, just like right here, / without saying \"let my turn come\", swiftly / warding off the surging great army, / he will stand there, he is of such manly character!","translation":"Refrain from anger, O men of little worth, complaining, 'He stood grasping his sharp sword, warding us off as we tried to share the king's close confidence when sweet, cool toddy was offered to him!' If he so desires, just as he does here, he will not wait saying 'let my turn come,' but will swiftly ward off the surging great army and stand there on the battlefield. Such is his manly character!","modern":"அரசனுக்குப் படைக்கப்பட்ட இனிய குளிர்ந்த கள்ளைப் பருகி, அவனோடு நெருங்கிப் பழக நாம் முயன்றபோது, 'அவன் தன் கூர்மையான வாளைப் பிடித்துக்கொண்டு நம்மைத் தடுத்து நின்றான்' என்று கூறி, அவமதிக்கும் சிறிய குணமுடையவர்களே, நீங்கள் கோபப்படுவதைத் தவிருங்கள்! அவன் விரும்பினால், இங்கிருப்பது போலவே, 'எனது முறை வரட்டும்' என்று காத்திருக்காமல், விரைந்து எழுந்து வரும் பகைவரின் பெரும்படையைத் தடுத்து நிறுத்தி, அங்கே போர்க்களத்தில் தனியாக நிற்பான். அவன் அத்தகைய ஆண்மைப் பண்பு உடையவன் ஆவான்!","explanation":"This poem belongs to the Vañci tiṇai (forest/invasion theme) and the Peruñcōṟṟu nilai tuṟai, which depicts the grand feast given by a king to his warriors before they march to battle. The speaker, a companion of the hero, addresses the jealous rivals who are angry because the hero stood guard and prevented them from getting close to the king while sweet toddy was being served. The speaker tells these petty men to refrain from anger, explaining that the hero's closeness to the king is well-deserved. He points out that when a real battle begins, the hero will not wait for his turn to fight, but will instantly rush forward to block the entire surging enemy army. The key words are 'ciṟupullāḷar' (men of little worth) and 'āṇṭakaiyaṉ' (man of noble character).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.8],[0.8,1.5],[1.5,1.9],[2.07,2.9],[2.9,3.19],[3.48,3.54],[3.6,4.1],[4.1,5.1],[5.1,5.3],[5.3,5.7],[5.7,6.2],[6.2,7.1],[7.1,7.5],[7.5,7.6],[7.6,8.0],[8.0,9.3],[9.3,9.3],[9.3,9.7],[9.7,10.1],[10.1,11.2],[11.2,11.52],[11.6,12.0],[12.0,12.1],[12.1,13.5],[13.5,13.6],[13.6,14.0],[14.0,14.8],[14.8,15.2],[15.2,15.6],[15.68,16.0]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,0.9],[0.9,1.7],[1.7,2.2],[2.35,3.1],[3.23,3.5],[3.5,3.95],[4.1,4.5],[4.5,5.6],[5.6,5.8],[5.8,6.3],[6.53,6.8],[6.8,7.7],[7.7,8.2],[8.2,8.3],[8.3,8.7],[8.7,10.0],[10.0,10.1],[10.1,10.4],[10.4,10.9],[10.9,11.8],[11.8,12.2],[12.2,12.8],[12.8,12.8],[12.8,14.4],[14.4,14.6],[14.6,15.0],[15.0,16.1],[16.1,16.5],[16.5,16.9],[17.0,17.3]]},"sync":[[["வேந்தற்கு","to the king"]],[["ஏந்திய","offered"]],[["தீந்தண்","sweet and cool"]],[["நறவம்","toddy"]],[["யாம்","we"],["தனக்கு","to him"]],[["உறுமறை","close confidence"]],[["வளாவ","to mingle"]],[["விலக்கி","warding off"]],[["வாய்வாள்","sharp sword"]],[["பற்றி","grasping"]],[["நின்றனென்","he stood"]],[["என்று","saying"]],[["சினவல்","anger"]],[["ஓம்புமின்","refrain from"]],[["சிறுபுல்லாளர்","men of little worth"]],[["சிறுபுல்லாளர்","men of little worth"]],[["ஈண்டே","right here"]],[["போல","like"]],[["வேண்டுவன்","he desires"]],[["ஆயின்","if"]],[["என்முறை","my turn"]],[["வருக","let it come"]],[["என்னான்","without saying"]],[["கம்மென","swiftly"]],[["எழுதரு","surging"]],[["பெரும்படை","great army"]],[["விலக்கி","warding off"]],[["ஆண்டு","there"]],[["நிற்கும்","will stand"]],[["ஆண்தகையன்னே","he is of manly character"]],[["ஆண்தகையன்னே","he is of manly character"]]]}